  "geometryNotes": "Deck profile, arch haunches and pier sections estimated from registered across-bay photographs. The Jubilee link has three spans and two main piers. The road bridge has seven spans. The road bridge has six in-water piers. The south three were located against the 2010 photograph. The brown-grey recessed openings above the pier heads use the shape visible in that photograph. The approach grades and the two pedestrian bridge pier stations are estimates.",
